+    Example:
+        >>> # xdoctest: +SKIP
+        >>> sampler = RandomSampler(dataset)
+        >>> it = iter(sampler)
+        >>> seen = [next(it) for _ in range(10)]
+        >>> state = sampler.state_dict()  # save it alongside the model checkpoint
